<title>UK: Nissan Diesel sets 10 bln yen convertible.</title>
<headline>Nissan Diesel sets 10 bln yen convertible.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following convertible bond was announced by lead manager IBJ International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NISSAN DIESEL MOTOR CO LTD</p>
<p> AMT    10.0 BLN YEN  COUPON     0.125 PCT MATURITY    31.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE   S14.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5 PCT   REOFFER    =	   S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
